			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is an intense modern martial artist in his early 30s inspired by Wu Jing, wearing a dark fitted tactical jacket, tactical trousers, and combat boots, utilizing sharp Bajiquan and Sanda striking.\n<Subject 2> is a precise, sleek operative wearing a dark grey tailored shirt and fingerless leather gloves, utilizing rapid Kali and Wing Chun defensive traps.\n\nsummary:\n[Text-to-Video generation] A 10-second continuous, fluid modern action scene in a narrow, neon-lit alleyway under light rain. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> engage in an ultra-fast, seamless chain of strikes, parries, and counter-attacks, with the camera orbiting tightly around their fluid movements until both land simultaneous counter-blocks in a breathless stalemate.\n\nretention_analysis:\nN/A - Pure text-to-video scene with no reference image input.\n\ndetailed_description:\nprfight1, prfin1\nThe video is a single continuous 10-second shot rendered in 1.0x real-time speed with cinematic high-shutter clarity, wet pavement reflections, and anamorphic lens flares.\n[Shot 1] The seamless fight sequence unfolds continuously in the tight alleyway space.\n- From 00:00.000 to 00:03.000: <Subject 1> initiates a rapid two-punch Sanda combination. <Subject 2> fluidly redirects the fists with a palm trap and instantly counters with a high horizontal elbow, which <Subject 1> smoothly duck-slips underneath without breaking stride.\n- From 00:03.000 to 00:06.500: Transitioning without pause, <Subject 1> drives a low Bajiquan chest strike; <Subject 2> absorbs the angle by spinning along the alley wall, sweeping <Subject 1>'s arm aside to deliver a swift knee counter. <Subject 1> blocks the knee with his forearm and immediately steps inward to attack.\n- From 00:06.500 to 00:10.000: The camera executes a dynamic, fluid 360-degree orbit around the pair as they trade an uninterrupted, lightning-fast exchange of forearm blocks, palm deflections, and short punches. On the final second, both thrust a definitive finishing strike—each simultaneously trapping the other's striking wrist an inch from their throat, freezing in a perfect, tense standstill as rain drips past them.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nContinuous rapid leather and fabric swishes, heavy visceral forearm clash thuds (\"thump-thump-thump!\"), wet boot squeaks on slick pavement, sharp rhythmic exhales, and ambient falling rain.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
